{"ID":"20240314092326-e1jqbb4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092326-e1jqbb4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092326-e1jqbb4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155711-mv02b7y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155711-49264ky\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155711-49264ky\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:18,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:18\u0026#125;","title":"【柴胡姜桂汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422155711"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422155711-mv02b7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155711-mv02b7y","updated":"20240422155711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡桂姜汤（柴胡姜桂汤）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155711-rp23jhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155711-rp23jhj","updated":"20240422155711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疟寒多，微有热，或但寒不热。（服一剂如神）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155711-ow0n5jl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155711-ow0n5jl","updated":"20240422155711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡半斤桂枝三两（去皮）干姜二两黄芩三两栝蒌根四两牡蛎三两（熬）甘草二两（炙）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155711-3lkky0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155711-3lkky0a","updated":"20240422155711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味，以水一斗二升，煮取六升，去滓，再煎取三升，温服一升，日三服，初服微烦，复服汗出便愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155711-15gcy7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155711-15gcy7c","updated":"20240422155711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一个方剂补充呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎汤治疗牝疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用牡蛎、麻黄、甘草、蜀漆，那你蜀漆不要用你用常山苗就可以了，四味药，这是我们来补充前面这个比较含糊的地方，或是有些方子还没有出来，没有出方的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155711-3506dfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155711-3506dfq","updated":"20240422155711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那第二个补充呢，68 页的补充方就是，这是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"劳疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这种呢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就是在外面劳力工作的人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得到的疟。那你用小柴胡汤把半夏拿掉换成栝蒌根。所以病人会有往来寒热，处方的时候疟疾也是一样，病人忽冷忽热，那如果忽冷忽热还没有呕心，哦，你可以把半夏拿掉，把栝蒌根加上去，因为他有渴躁渴的现象，躁渴的现象。所以柴胡汤呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小柴胡汤这个汤剂呢就是很好的一个治疟的一个处方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你如果配合针灸，我们前面介绍过，在针灸的时候有讲过，比如说我们曲池啊、外关啊、委中啊，都可以治疗疟疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155711-ghi3f0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155711-ghi3f0r","updated":"20240422155711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三个补充方就最后一个，柴胡姜桂汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡姜桂汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，这个专门也是比较治疗里面"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的，寒疟的。所以你寒疟的时候，你如果找不到蜀漆啊，云母，云母还要烧两天两夜，找不到你就用柴胡姜桂汤就可以了，就代表胃里面的寒湿中膈的寒湿呢我们用干姜来去掉，处方就是柴胡姜桂汤，所以......柴胡姜桂汤柴胡姜桂汤里面就是用什么，用牡蛎，对不对？用牡蛎，咸的能软坚。那我们知道疟里面呢，一定都有痰在里面，痰在里面，所以说这个用干姜啊牡蛎来热的药来把这个痰化出来。你如果说这个处方下去以后，柴胡姜桂汤下去病人痰还有，你一般来说你可以加常山呐，还有南星啊......天南星啊，这都是能够去痰的药，中药的去痰药很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155711-49264ky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155711-49264ky","updated":"20240422155711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个条辩比较短，疟病就是专门讲疟疾。"}]}]}